# ZL Inflator for WebCLAP

ZLInflator by ZL Audio (zsliu98), a distortion/saturation plugin to increase loudness, ported to WebCLAP. This is
not an official ZL Audio release.

- ZLInflator: https://github.com/ZL-Audio/ZLInflator (commit b71bf48, after version 0.3.0)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-zl-inflator.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

Changes in this port (`patches/zl-inflator-webclap.patch`): the processor builds without its editor, and its meters
hand what they measured to the editor's meters in the page. The editor's UI settings (style, window size) live in
the page's memory and are gone when it reloads.

